abstract: "Exact integer certificates excluding 276-point caps in AG(7,3), using cited low-dimensional classification results. Includes proofs, complete fresh Python and C++ verification logs, separately written auxiliary audit code, and a 236-point cap. The earlier upper-279 checkpoint remains available. AI assistance and shared dependencies are disclosed in README.md and upper275/AUDIT.md."
